[{"ave_id":"AVE-2010-0084","file_name":"2010/AVE-2010-0084.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2010-20103","title":"ProFTPD 1.3.3c 版本源码后门隐藏命令任意命令执行漏洞","description":"ProFTPD 1.3.3c 官方源码包在 2010 年 11 月 28 日至 12 月 2 日期间被植入恶意后门，攻击者通过触发隐藏的 FTP 命令即可以 root 权限在服务器上执行任意 Shell 命令。该漏洞影响使用该版本源码编译安装的 ProFTPD 服务器，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.3，属严重级别供应链投毒型漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2010-20103"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2025-08-20T16:15:34.137","updated":"2026-07-15T02:16:56.140","remediation":"立即从官方渠道重新下载并升级到 ProFTPD 1.3.3d 或更高版本（1.3.3d 已移除该后门），严禁使用 2010 年 11 月 28 日至 12 月 2 日期间下载的 1.3.3c 源码包或二进制文件。升级前校验官方 GPG 签名与 SHA 校验和，确认软件完整性；若已部署受影响版本，应重置服务器凭据并检查是否存在异常 root 权限命令执行记录作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.proftpd.org/","https://advisories.checkpoint.com/defense/advisories/public/2011/cpai-2010-151.html/","https://github.com/proftpd/proftpd","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/master/modules/exploits/unix/ftp/proftpd_133c_backdoor.rb","https://web.archive.org/web/20111107212129/http://rsync.proftpd.org/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/15662","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16921","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/proftpd-backdoor-command-execution","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/javascript/cves/2010/CVE-2010-20103.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/8600ac0c091970175de0b53d9682f50858aef8dc/2010/CVE-2010-20103.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/6bfef5eb290cbfeb2b2cb4d2bae8e5cab0243137/javascript/cves/2010/CVE-2010-20103.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c1abd567e9f51bcb187554798cc5956bd402e98/cves/2010/20xxx/CVE-2010-20103.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2010/CVE-2010-20103.rules","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f75ab9c4d42c6ac0916ce14ac69865bf1dcbb973/2010/20xxx/CVE-2010-20103.json","https://github.co